# WalletConnect / Reown Project ID — required for wallet connections on mobile and desktop.
# 1. Create a project at https://cloud.reown.com
# 2. Under Project → Domains, add: offline-pay-celo.vercel.app
# 3. Copy the Project ID and set it here (and in your Vercel environment variables).
# Without a valid project ID and verified domain, WalletConnect will fail on mobile.
